cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "pq-emv-tap"
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Alternateacc-1/pq-emv-tap"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for the ICTCS 2026 paper "Does Post-Quantum Card Authentication Fit a
  Contactless Tap? A Test Against EMV's Own Rules". An exact timing and memory model of
  post-quantum card authentication (ML-DSA, FN-DSA, ML-KEM) in three EMV kernel
  architectures, built from the EMV specifications and published measurements, that
  regenerates every number and figure in the paper.
keywords:
  - EMV
  - contactless
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ML-DSA
  - ML-KEM
  - FN-DSA
  - smart cards
authors:
